I walk to the corner.
The stop is there.
A tram comes.
I get on.
It is warm inside.
I sit by the window.
We set off.
We drive straight ahead.
I look out of the window.
I see many streets and buildings.
Everything is unfamiliar and new.
We turn left.
Then we drive straight ahead again.
The U-Bahn is dark.
But here I see the city.
Berlin is big and interesting.
Sabine is right.
The ride is very nice.
